{"seq":1,"slug":"listing-checkout-inbound-gate","title":"发布/下单/入仓多关卡可售性校验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/sellability-gates/listing-checkout-inbound-gate","wordCount":2067,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"发布-下单-入仓多关卡可售性校验\">发布/下单/入仓多关卡可售性校验</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>同一份准入规则必须在多个环节被反复校验，因为<strong>每个环节能做的动作完全不同</strong>。发布环节只能拒绝上架或要求补材料；下单环节能拒绝交易但已产生用户预期；入仓环节面对的是已经到仓的实物，拒绝的代价是退货、滞留与仓储费。如果只在其中一个环节校验，风险就会从该环节向两侧泄漏——只在发布时校验，则资质过期后仍可继续卖；只在下单时校验，则不可售商品会先被卖家批量上传，制造大量用户可见的失败。</p>\n<p>多关卡设计的核心不是「多校验几次」，而是<strong>每个关卡承接不同的失败策略</strong>，并且共享同一份判定结果与版本号。校验用的规则版本必须一致，否则会出现「发布时允许、下单时拒绝」的矛盾，而这在卖家侧是不可解释的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关卡</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n<th>可执行动作</th>\n<th>失败策略</th>\n<th>关键要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>发布/上架</td>\n<td>卖家提交商品</td>\n<td>拒绝保存、要求补材料</td>\n<td>严格（fail-closed）</td>\n<td>一次性全量求值，结果可缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下单/结算</td>\n<td>买家提交订单</td>\n<td>拒绝交易、提示替代</td>\n<td>精确（按行拦截）</td>\n<td>低延迟，需订单级数量与金额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入仓/收货</td>\n<td>货到仓库或口岸</td>\n<td>拒收、暂扣、转处置</td>\n<td>物理优先</td>\n<td>需随货文件与实物一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算/放款</td>\n<td>资金清算前</td>\n<td>暂扣货款</td>\n<td>事后纠偏</td>\n<td>需可回溯的判定快照</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  subgraph 发布关卡&#10;    L1[商品提交] --&gt; E1[全量求值]&#10;    E1 --&gt;|BLOCK| R1[拒绝保存 + 缺失清单]&#10;    E1 --&gt;|ALLOW_WITH_CONDITIONS| R2[保存并挂待办]&#10;    E1 --&gt;|ALLOW| R3[保存 + 缓存判定快照]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 下单关卡&#10;    O1[订单行] --&gt; E2[按 item×market 求值]&#10;    E2 --&gt;|BLOCK| R4[拦截该行 + 替代市场提示]&#10;    E2 --&gt;|需运行时校验| R5[验龄/配额扣减]&#10;  end&#10;  subgraph 入仓关卡&#10;    I1[入库/报关] --&gt; E3[校验随货文件与实物]&#10;    E3 --&gt;|不符| R6[拒收 + 生成处置任务]&#10;  end&#10;  R3 -.判定快照复用.-&gt; E2\">graph TD\n  subgraph 发布关卡\n    L1[商品提交] --&gt; E1[全量求值]\n    E1 --&gt;|BLOCK| R1[拒绝保存 + 缺失清单]\n    E1 --&gt;|ALLOW_WITH_CONDITIONS| R2[保存并挂待办]\n    E1 --&gt;|ALLOW| R3[保存 + 缓存判定快照]\n  end\n  subgraph 下单关卡\n    O1[订单行] --&gt; E2[按 item×market 求值]\n    E2 --&gt;|BLOCK| R4[拦截该行 + 替代市场提示]\n    E2 --&gt;|需运行时校验| R5[验龄/配额扣减]\n  end\n  subgraph 入仓关卡\n    I1[入库/报关] --&gt; E3[校验随货文件与实物]\n    E3 --&gt;|不符| R6[拒收 + 生成处置任务]\n  end\n  R3 -.判定快照复用.-&gt; E2</pre><h2 id=\"发布关卡-一次求值-长期复用\">发布关卡：一次求值，长期复用</h2><p>发布关卡的优势是<strong>可以慢</strong>。此时没有实时用户等待，可以执行全量求值：遍历商品在所有目标市场的规则、核验全部条件、生成完整的缺失清单。它的输出不只是允许/禁止，还包括**「这个商品可以卖到哪些市场」**这一反向查询结果——这正是卖家最想知道的。</p>\n<p>发布关卡的失败策略必须是 fail-closed：关键事实缺失（危险品分类未知、资质状态未知）应当拒绝或要求补齐，而不是放行。原因是这个环节的纠错成本最低，而一旦放行，错误会向下游所有环节传播。</p>\n<p>发布关卡的产出应当被缓存为<strong>判定快照</strong>：<code>(item_id, market) → {outcome, tier, conditions, rule_version, decided_at}</code>。后续关卡优先复用快照，只在快照失效（规则版本更新、资质到期、商品属性变更）时才重新求值。这样把最贵的全量求值集中到发布时刻。</p>\n<h3 id=\"快照失效的判定\">快照失效的判定</h3><p>快照失效条件必须显式枚举，不能靠「定期重算」碰运气。至少三条触发：<code>rule_version</code> 不再是当前生效版本、快照里引用的资质状态变更、商品关键属性（成分、容量、分类编码）变更。商品属性变更尤其重要——改一个容量字段可能让危险品分类从 UN 3481 变成 UN 3480，准入结论随之改变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下单关卡-低延迟与订单级事实\">下单关卡：低延迟与订单级事实</h2><p>下单关卡的限制是延迟。它需要在购物车与结算链路上以毫秒级完成，且必须处理<strong>订单级事实</strong>：数量（限售总量）、金额与货值（税务条件与低值豁免）、目的地（市场下钻到州/省）、收货人（年龄校验）。</p>\n<p>下单关卡的求值策略是<strong>快照 + 增量校验</strong>：从快照取基础结论，再叠加只能在此刻知道的事实。例如限售数量约束只有此刻才知道总件数，选用 <a href=\"restricted-quota-permit-check\">限售数量/许可证实时校验</a> 里的配额校验路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"按行拦截而非整单拒绝\">按行拦截而非整单拒绝</h3><p>一个购物车可能同时含可售与不可售商品。整单拒绝会把可售部分一起损失掉，用户体验也差。正确做法是<strong>按订单行拦截</strong>：把不可售的行标记出来，其余行正常提交，并给出替代建议（换市场、换规格、去掉受限成分）。这与替代市场的计算相关，见 <a href=\"destination-block-alt-market\">目的地不可售拦截与替代市场提示</a>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;cart_id&quot;: &quot;C-88213&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lines&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;item_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-90021&quot;, &quot;market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;, &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;ALLOW&quot;, &quot;qty&quot;: 2 },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;item_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-31500&quot;,&#10;      &quot;market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;BLOCK&quot;,&#10;      &quot;reason_code&quot;: &quot;RESTRICTED_QTY_EXCEEDED&quot;,&#10;      &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;rule:restricted-qty-DE-lithium&quot;,&#10;      &quot;alternatives&quot;: { &quot;reduce_qty_to&quot;: 1, &quot;alt_markets&quot;: [&quot;FR&quot;, &quot;NL&quot;] }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;item_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-11902&quot;,&#10;      &quot;market&quot;: &quot;DE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;outcome&quot;: &quot;ALLOW_WITH_CONDITIONS&quot;,&#10;      &quot;runtime_check&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;AGE_GATE&quot;, &quot;min_age&quot;: 18 }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cart_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C-88213\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lines\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-90021\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ALLOW\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"item_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-31500\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BLOCK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"reason_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RESTRICTED_QTY_EXCEEDED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule:restricted-qty-DE-lithium\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"alternatives\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reduce_qty_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alt_markets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"item_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-11902\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outcome\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ALLOW_WITH_CONDITIONS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"runtime_check\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AGE_GATE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reason_code</code> 与 <code>basis</code> 是必需的，它们是卖家侧与客服侧可解释性的唯一来源。缺了 <code>basis</code>，客服无法回答「为什么这个商品不能买」，只能给通用话术。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定结果的幂等与并发\">判定结果的幂等与并发</h3><p>下单关卡的求值必须是幂等的且对并发的。同一订单在支付重试时会被重复求值，判断结果不能因为重试而变化（除非规则版本或配额变了）。因此求值应当<strong>无副作用</strong>，把扣减配额的副作用移到配额服务里用原子操作完成，而不是在求值函数内部就地扣减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"入仓关卡-物理一致性\">入仓关卡：物理一致性</h2><p>入仓关卡的判定对象不是商品主数据，而是<strong>随货的实物与文件</strong>。它要回答的是「这批到仓的货，是否与获准销售的规格一致」。这一层的失败模式与其他关卡不同：它可能遇到「判定允许但实物不符」（例如实际容量与申报不符导致危险品分类错误），也可能遇到「文件缺失导致无法举证」。</p>\n<p>入仓关卡的关键动作是<strong>一致性比对</strong>：把装箱单、随货文件（符合性声明、检测报告、许可证明）与实物标识（批次号、序列号、包装等级标记）三者对齐。不一致时的处置是暂扣而非直接拒收，因为暂扣保留纠正机会（补文件、重新分拣）。</p>\n<p>以医疗器械为例，MDR 要求器械带 UDI，Basic UDI-DI 作为同一制造商可比器械组的关键标识（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regulation_(EU)_2017/745\">Regulation (EU) 2017/745</a>）。入仓比对的天然锚点就是这类标识，没有它只能靠人工。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 入仓一致性比对：到仓记录 vs 获准规格 vs 随货文件&#10;SELECT s.shipment_id, s.item_id, s.market_code,&#10;       s.declared_class AS 申报危险品类别,&#10;       a.approved_class AS 获准类别,&#10;       (s.declared_class = a.approved_class) AS 分类一致,&#10;       EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM docs d&#10;                WHERE d.shipment_id = s.shipment_id&#10;                  AND d.doc_type = &#39;DECLARATION_OF_CONFORMITY&#39;&#10;                  AND d.valid_to &gt;= CURRENT_DATE) AS 文件齐全,&#10;       CASE WHEN s.declared_class &lt;&gt; a.approved_class THEN &#39;HOLD_AND_REVIEW&#39;&#10;            WHEN NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM docs d&#10;                              WHERE d.shipment_id = s.shipment_id) THEN &#39;HOLD_MISSING_DOCS&#39;&#10;            ELSE &#39;RELEASE&#39; END AS 处置建议&#10;FROM inbound_shipment s&#10;JOIN approved_spec a&#10;  ON a.item_id = s.item_id AND a.market_code = s.market_code;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 入仓一致性比对：到仓记录 vs 获准规格 vs 随货文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 申报危险品类别,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">approved_class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 获准类别,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">approved_class</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 分类一致,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> docs d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">doc_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DECLARATION_OF_CONFORMITY'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">valid_to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 文件齐全,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">approved_class</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'HOLD_AND_REVIEW'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> docs d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                              WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'HOLD_MISSING_DOCS'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASE'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 处置建议</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inbound_shipment s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> approved_spec a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"入仓不是最后一道闸门\">入仓不是最后一道闸门</h3><p>把入仓当作最后防线的想法会遗漏一个场景：<strong>已通关的货在销售期内法规收紧</strong>。此时货已经在本地仓，判定结果从 <code>ALLOW</code> 变成 <code>BLOCK</code>，需要的是「停止销售并处置库存」，而不是「拒收」。这要求入仓之后还有持续的在售复核，它由快照失效机制驱动。存量货物的处置（退运、销毁、转售他市场）属于另一个主题的范围，本 hub 只负责把判定结果与处置建议传给履约系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关卡间的一致性\">关卡间的一致性</h2><p>多关卡最容易出的问题是<strong>结论不一致</strong>，而它往往源于三处实现差异：规则版本不一致、事实来源不一致、失败策略不一致。三者的防御措施分别是：把 <code>rule_version</code> 放进每次判定结果并在关卡间传递；让所有关卡从同一批事实服务取数；把失败策略写成关卡配置而非散落的代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;  participant S as 卖家&#10;  participant P as 发布服务&#10;  participant M as 矩阵引擎&#10;  participant O as 下单服务&#10;  participant W as 入仓服务&#10;  S-&gt;&gt;P: 提交商品×市场&#10;  P-&gt;&gt;M: 求值(全量, as_of)&#10;  M--&gt;&gt;P: outcome + rule_version=v42&#10;  P--&gt;&gt;S: 结果 + 缺失清单&#10;  O-&gt;&gt;M: 求值(快照 v42 + 订单事实)&#10;  M--&gt;&gt;O: 按行结果&#10;  W-&gt;&gt;M: 求值(规格一致性)&#10;  M--&gt;&gt;W: 处置建议\">sequenceDiagram\n  participant S as 卖家\n  participant P as 发布服务\n  participant M as 矩阵引擎\n  participant O as 下单服务\n  participant W as 入仓服务\n  S-&gt;&gt;P: 提交商品×市场\n  P-&gt;&gt;M: 求值(全量, as_of)\n  M--&gt;&gt;P: outcome + rule_version=v42\n  P--&gt;&gt;S: 结果 + 缺失清单\n  O-&gt;&gt;M: 求值(快照 v42 + 订单事实)\n  M--&gt;&gt;O: 按行结果\n  W-&gt;&gt;M: 求值(规格一致性)\n  M--&gt;&gt;W: 处置建议</pre><p>图中 <code>v42</code> 被显式传递，这是关卡一致性的技术抓手：只要所有关卡引用同一版本号，结论差异就只可能来自事实差异，排查范围立刻收窄。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多关卡的价值在于各关卡承接不同的失败策略，而不在于多校验几次；关卡间必须共享规则版本与事实来源。</li>\n<li>发布关卡可慢、可全量、fail-closed，产出反向结果（可售市场列表）并缓存判定快照。</li>\n<li>下单关卡是快照 + 增量校验，必须处理订单级事实（数量、货值、目的地、收货人），并按订单行拦截而非整单拒绝。</li>\n<li>判定结果要带 <code>reason_code</code> 与 <code>basis</code> 才能被卖家与客服解释；求值必须无副作用、幂等、对并发安全。</li>\n<li>入仓关卡判定的是实物与文件的一致性而非主数据，不一致时暂扣优于拒收。</li>\n<li>入仓不是最后闸门：在售期内法规收紧需要靠快照失效驱动在售复核。</li>\n<li>关卡一致性依赖三件事对齐：<code>rule_version</code> 传递、事实服务统一、失败策略配置化。</li>\n<li>下一步：不可售时的替代路径，见 <a href=\"destination-block-alt-market\">目的地不可售拦截与替代市场提示</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发布/下单/入仓多关卡可售性校验","id":"发布-下单-入仓多关卡可售性校验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"发布关卡：一次求值，长期复用","id":"发布关卡-一次求值-长期复用"},{"level":3,"text":"快照失效的判定","id":"快照失效的判定"},{"level":2,"text":"下单关卡：低延迟与订单级事实","id":"下单关卡-低延迟与订单级事实"},{"level":3,"text":"按行拦截而非整单拒绝","id":"按行拦截而非整单拒绝"},{"level":3,"text":"判定结果的幂等与并发","id":"判定结果的幂等与并发"},{"level":2,"text":"入仓关卡：物理一致性","id":"入仓关卡-物理一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"入仓不是最后一道闸门","id":"入仓不是最后一道闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"关卡间的一致性","id":"关卡间的一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"准入数据来源、时效与规则版本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/eligibility-condition-data/eligibility-source-freshness-version"},"next":{"title":"目的地不可售拦截与替代市场提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-market-eligibility-matrix/sellability-gates/destination-block-alt-market"}}